vuk|a|Smooth and shining; reflecting luster from a smooth surface; highly polished; lustrous; as, glossy silk; a glossy surface. ; Smooth; specious; plausible; as, glossy deceit.	j:sj1,78,3;21lc,61,4;1wa7,59,3~21lc,61,4;1wa7,59,3;sj1,78,3
